__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
dist/
build/
target/
.env
*.db
*.sqlite3

# Real bulk USDA data, ~10MB and growing once the full enrichment pass
# runs against all ~90,000 species -- reproducible via data/build_phase0.py,
# not something to carry in git history. CC0-licensed, re-downloadable
# any time from https://hosted-datasets.gbif.org/datasets/usda.zip
data/raw/

# Per-species cached API responses (35,326 files) and the run log --
# reproducible via data/ingest_full.py against the real USDA API,
# not something to carry in git history.
data/cache/
data/ingest_full.log

# The one real exception to `*.db` above: the bundled app resource is a
# required build input (tauri.conf.json's bundle.resources references
# it), not a generated artifact -- the app can't build from a fresh
# clone without it. A user's own live copy (created at runtime in their
# real per-OS app data directory, outside this repo entirely) is what
# `*.db` is actually meant to exclude.
!app/src-tauri/resources/baneward.db
